<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1858) <span class="when">Oct 27, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Live Only in the Review Manager</b>: a switch under the filter, on by default, lists just the reviews still running. Beside it, how many ended ones are hidden; click that to show them all.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<div class="earlier">Earlier updates</div>
<h3>1.0 (build 1855) <span class="when">Oct 26, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Much smaller notes reports</b>: pictures in an exported notes PDF are kept at their printed size, so a report of 4K frames is a few MB, not hundreds.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1852) <span class="when">Oct 26, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Zoom 100% is the source&#8217;s own pixels</b>, and the Fit to Window check mark updates the moment the view changes.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1849) <span class="when">Oct 26, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed: Fit to Window and Zoom 100%</b> are separate again: 100% no longer snaps back to fit, and the View menu checks one or the other.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1846) <span class="when">Oct 26, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Improvements and fixes.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1843) <span class="when">Oct 26, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Improvements and fixes.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1840) <span class="when">Oct 26, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Improvements and fixes.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1837) <span class="when">Oct 26, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Improvements and fixes.</li>
</ul>
